WEBVTT

00:00:01.252 --> 00:00:05.464
Ima kara utau koto koko dake no hanashi ni

00:00:06.924 --> 00:00:08.926
<i>Shite oite ne</i>

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:14.724
<i>Yokubou wa kokoro ni
kakushite okitai no hontou wa</i>

00:00:14.807 --> 00:00:16.851
<i>Himitsu himitsu</i>

00:00:33.117 --> 00:00:35.703
<i>Chikamichi shitai</i>

00:00:35.786 --> 00:00:39.582
<i>Ame ni nureru koto naku</i>

00:00:39.665 --> 00:00:43.211
Kaze ni tobasareru koto naku

00:00:43.294 --> 00:00:47.006
Zurugashikokute mo waratte ne

00:00:47.089 --> 00:00:51.469
<i>Hikyoumono demo asonde ne</i>

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:55.056
Kanashimitakunai

00:00:55.139 --> 00:00:58.935
Namida ni nureru koto naku

00:00:59.018 --> 00:01:02.563
<i>Tohou ni kureru koto</i> naku

00:01:02.647 --> 00:01:06.025
Donkan datte waratte ne

00:01:06.108 --> 00:01:11.072
<i>Tanoshii koto dake oshiete ne</i>

00:01:14.825 --> 00:01:19.372
<i>Mitai kao ga aru no kikitai koe ga aru no</i>

00:01:20.581 --> 00:01:24.252
Me <i>ga</i> sametara yorokobi wo narashite

00:01:24.335 --> 00:01:30.299
<i>Ohayou, kyou mo yoroshiku onegai itashimasu</i>

00:01:30.299 --> 00:01:30.967
"Princess Jellyfish"

00:01:38.182 --> 00:01:41.143
Whoa, talk about dusty!

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:50.736
This place should have a bunch of stuff.

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:51.988
Look!

00:01:52.071 --> 00:01:53.864
Ugh, lame!

00:01:55.116 --> 00:01:57.201
Oh, how cute!

00:01:57.285 --> 00:01:59.870
This stuff isn't cute at all!

00:01:59.954 --> 00:02:04.125
Are you sure? I think it's really cute.

00:02:09.046 --> 00:02:11.007
N-Next box!

00:02:15.886 --> 00:02:17.972
You can tell this belongs to an old family...

00:02:18.055 --> 00:02:22.226
The boxes go all the way to the
back in layers, like geologic strata!

00:02:22.810 --> 00:02:24.395
Strata...

00:02:25.146 --> 00:02:26.605
Which means...!

00:02:26.689 --> 00:02:29.358
Tsukimi! We'll shove aside
the young strata in front of us

00:02:29.442 --> 00:02:32.028
and aim for the ancient ones in the back!

00:02:39.035 --> 00:02:43.164
Excavation successful!
We have '70s retro dead stock!

00:02:43.247 --> 00:02:44.040
Lame!

00:02:44.081 --> 00:02:45.666
Morons!

00:02:46.375 --> 00:02:48.169
This set is way cooler.

00:02:48.252 --> 00:02:50.212
Oh, you think so, too?

00:02:50.296 --> 00:02:51.964
I'm telling you, you're morons!

00:02:52.048 --> 00:02:55.551
Trendy shops are selling this
stuff for big money right now!

00:02:55.634 --> 00:02:57.553
This lot should bring in
about a hundred thousand.

00:02:57.636 --> 00:02:58.763
A...

00:02:58.763 --> 00:03:00.181
"Nun"

00:03:00.181 --> 00:03:01.223
A hundred thousand yen?!

00:03:01.223 --> 00:03:03.184
"Million Dollar Babies"

00:03:06.145 --> 00:03:11.776
Shu. I hear that developer will be
at next week's study group meeting.

00:03:11.859 --> 00:03:15.529
I trust all our materials are ready?

00:03:15.613 --> 00:03:18.199
I'm sorry, I'm still working...

00:03:20.242 --> 00:03:22.745
You go on ahead, Shu.

00:03:22.828 --> 00:03:23.788
L...

00:03:23.871 --> 00:03:25.456
All right.

00:03:28.459 --> 00:03:31.420
Something seems off about Shu.

00:03:31.504 --> 00:03:33.881
He looks the same as ever to me.

00:03:33.964 --> 00:03:36.384
You can buy those wheels you
were talking about for the Benz.

00:03:36.467 --> 00:03:40.054
A beautiful, seductive woman
came over to deliver his glasses.

00:03:41.972 --> 00:03:43.641
So he has a girlfriend?

00:03:43.724 --> 00:03:46.727
It seems he's overcome that
trauma and successfully had sex with--

00:03:46.811 --> 00:03:50.773
Hey, watch your mouth!
Remember where we are!

00:03:50.856 --> 00:03:55.194
But that raises problems of a different sort...

00:03:55.277 --> 00:03:58.072
Investigate this woman.

00:04:00.074 --> 00:04:01.659
I'm sorry, Sir.

00:04:04.829 --> 00:04:08.290
I'm an employee of the Koibuchi family,

00:04:08.374 --> 00:04:12.002
but I'm also Shu's childhood friend.

00:04:12.086 --> 00:04:19.176
I couldn't spy on him, even on your orders.

00:04:19.260 --> 00:04:21.720
I'll buy you a new Benz.

00:04:21.804 --> 00:04:26.225
Hey, Sugi, my man. I need a
background check on someone.

00:04:26.308 --> 00:04:30.438
Right, our spot. The Mister
Donut in Takadanobaba.

00:04:30.521 --> 00:04:33.357
Sugimoto, an old classmate
from my abacus school,

00:04:33.441 --> 00:04:36.026
is a private investigator now.

00:04:36.110 --> 00:04:37.820
Abacus school, eh?

00:04:47.121 --> 00:04:50.833
Oh, hey, what's this thing you brought?

00:04:50.916 --> 00:04:53.794
It's a Clara-themed good
weather charm that I made.

00:04:53.878 --> 00:04:56.464
You made it yourself? Wow.

00:04:56.547 --> 00:04:59.258
Well, we might be able to
sell it to a kid for 100 yen.

00:04:59.341 --> 00:05:02.136
Oh, how cute!

00:05:02.219 --> 00:05:03.262
How much?

00:05:03.345 --> 00:05:05.473
Three thousand yen, Miss!

00:05:05.556 --> 00:05:09.143
Three thousand yen?! That's so expensive!

00:05:09.226 --> 00:05:13.063
Aw, no it's not! After all, this is a Wedgewood--

00:05:13.147 --> 00:05:15.733
No, no, I want that!

00:05:17.193 --> 00:05:18.444
Huh? This?

00:05:18.527 --> 00:05:21.322
Yeah! It's super-cute!

00:05:23.449 --> 00:05:25.534
<i>L-I'll</i> let you have it for 500 yen.

00:05:25.618 --> 00:05:26.785
Okay!

00:05:28.204 --> 00:05:30.164
That was a good find, huh?

00:05:31.832 --> 00:05:33.918
It sold!

00:05:34.001 --> 00:05:36.003
Tsukimi, we're calling the gang over!

00:05:36.086 --> 00:05:37.046
Huh?

00:05:37.796 --> 00:05:38.714
What?

00:05:38.797 --> 00:05:42.092
Stuffed animals we don't
want and a sewing kit?

00:05:42.176 --> 00:05:44.970
Bring them? Right now?

00:05:45.054 --> 00:05:49.016
She says if we bring a sewing kit to
the flea market, she'll give us 5,000 yen.

00:05:49.099 --> 00:05:50.684
Let's go!

00:05:54.271 --> 00:05:56.649
I'll take an old-fashioned
donut and an iced coffee.

00:05:56.732 --> 00:06:00.653
A péo-de-ring donut
and an iced coffee for me.

00:06:00.736 --> 00:06:01.737
Yo.

00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:03.197
Sugi my man.

00:06:04.406 --> 00:06:08.536
Wow, political families have it rough, huh?

00:06:08.619 --> 00:06:14.250
I mean, if a grown man has to have
every girlfriend vetted by his parents...

00:06:14.333 --> 00:06:17.836
So, what's her name?

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:19.505
You don't know?

00:06:20.422 --> 00:06:23.592
Okay, draw her. Give me a sketch or something.

00:06:29.265 --> 00:06:32.059
Try drawing a Benz. S-Class.

00:06:32.142 --> 00:06:33.727
S-Class...?

00:06:38.232 --> 00:06:41.694
Sheesh, and you're good at drawing
what you're interested in, too...

00:06:41.777 --> 00:06:44.071
If you ever witness a hit-and-run,
you should do a sketch for the police.

00:06:44.154 --> 00:06:45.990
They'll give you an award.

00:06:46.073 --> 00:06:48.200
I can only draw Benzes, though.

00:06:48.284 --> 00:06:50.327
Anyway, I'm on it.

00:06:50.411 --> 00:06:53.831
I'll start tailing the young master today.

00:06:53.914 --> 00:06:56.667
Oh, have my donut, too.

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:59.878
Really? Thanks, Sugi!

00:06:59.962 --> 00:07:03.549
Okay, girls, thanks for coming!

00:07:03.632 --> 00:07:08.012
Th-Th-There are Stylish everywhere...!

00:07:09.763 --> 00:07:11.473
Hey, get back here!

00:07:11.557 --> 00:07:14.143
It's too much! This place is too much!

00:07:14.226 --> 00:07:17.646
You'll be fine. I'll make you
an "After" Sister right now.

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:20.733
There's you, you, and
you--and Chieko can stay as-is.

00:07:20.816 --> 00:07:22.026
Again?!

00:07:22.109 --> 00:07:24.069
You're hardly even trying this time.

00:07:24.153 --> 00:07:26.530
We have lots of work to do today!

00:07:26.614 --> 00:07:28.741
Are you finished, Tsukimi?

00:07:28.824 --> 00:07:30.117
Almost.

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:31.785
Hmm? Tsukimi?

00:07:31.869 --> 00:07:33.787
Come to think of it, where is Tsukimi?

00:07:33.871 --> 00:07:36.206
Sheesh. This is Tsukimi!

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:37.875
"After" Tsukimi.

00:07:40.002 --> 00:07:42.671
Sorry, I didn't recognize you at all...

00:07:42.755 --> 00:07:47.217
Forgive me, Tsukimi!
I took you for just another Stylish,

00:07:47.343 --> 00:07:51.680
--so I silently recited the word "Die!" at you two hundred
times! --It's okay. May I please wear my glasses?

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:53.599
--I'm so sorry!
--It's okay. May I please wear my glasses?

00:07:53.682 --> 00:07:55.017
Here.

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:57.728
We're all going to sit here and make Claras.

00:07:57.811 --> 00:08:00.064
You're... telling us to make those things?

00:08:00.147 --> 00:08:01.106
Why?

00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:02.816
To sell! We sold one!

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:05.486
Well, I'll be darned. For ten yen?

00:08:05.569 --> 00:08:07.071
For five hundred.

00:08:07.071 --> 00:08:07.905
"Five Hundred"

00:08:08.447 --> 00:08:12.910
But anyway... This doesn't look
like a jellyfish at all, Tsukimi.

00:08:12.993 --> 00:08:18.207
What? B-But you told me to make
Claras out of this pile of clothes, so...

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:21.251
Oh, please! You need to look for stuff!

00:08:21.335 --> 00:08:25.714
Fabric is the most
crucial element of fashion!

00:08:26.298 --> 00:08:28.258
This looks promising, right?

00:08:38.477 --> 00:08:40.437
A jellyfish's fluttering frills...

00:08:40.646 --> 00:08:41.897
"Directory of Today's Conferences"

00:08:46.985 --> 00:08:48.612
Goodness!

00:08:48.696 --> 00:08:49.863
Hello.

00:09:02.251 --> 00:09:07.798
I'm sorry, Sir. Please go on ahead;
I need to stop by the restroom first.

00:09:07.881 --> 00:09:11.093
Exactly why are you doing this?

00:09:11.176 --> 00:09:16.724
No need to worry--as long as you buy
me a drink tonight at my building's bar.

00:09:16.807 --> 00:09:18.767
And if I say no?

00:09:20.102 --> 00:09:23.188
Blackmail, I see. That's a crime, you know.

00:09:23.272 --> 00:09:27.651
I'm the type of woman who will
do anything to get what she wants.

00:09:31.155 --> 00:09:33.782
What you want is an
agreement with my father

00:09:33.866 --> 00:09:37.244
about the Amamizu
redevelopment project, isn't it?

00:09:37.327 --> 00:09:39.496
I'll be waiting for you tonight.

00:09:48.797 --> 00:09:50.174
The deal is sealed!

00:09:52.634 --> 00:09:54.720
Chiekds sewing at the speed of sound!

00:09:54.803 --> 00:09:56.805
I can't believe anyone
can sew that fast by hand!

00:09:56.889 --> 00:10:00.184
Of course we can. Hand-sewing is a
fundamental of traditional clothing.

00:10:00.267 --> 00:10:03.187
You have to turn a bolt of cloth into
a finished product entirely by hand,

00:10:03.270 --> 00:10:05.606
so if you can't be quick
about it there's no point.

00:10:05.689 --> 00:10:07.024
Here, it's done.

00:10:07.107 --> 00:10:10.736
S-S-S-Sissy!

00:10:10.819 --> 00:10:11.653
Like a Sister?

00:10:11.737 --> 00:10:15.199
No! This is Sissy the Sanderia
malayensis! A new character!

00:10:15.282 --> 00:10:18.619
This white lace is exactly what
a Sanderia malayensis looks like!

00:10:18.702 --> 00:10:21.038
Next let's take this lace and this cloth

00:10:21.121 --> 00:10:23.290
and make Sissy a little sister!

00:10:24.541 --> 00:10:28.337
Do you think those things will really sell?

00:10:28.420 --> 00:10:32.090
Of course not! Only a small child
wouldn't notice how cheap they are!

00:10:32.174 --> 00:10:33.425
This good weather charm is cute!

00:10:33.509 --> 00:10:34.468
How much is it?

00:10:34.551 --> 00:10:35.636
Five hundred yen.

00:10:35.719 --> 00:10:38.222
It sold! To a small child!

00:10:38.305 --> 00:10:42.226
That's not a good weather charm.
It's a jellyfish doll.

00:10:42.309 --> 00:10:44.770
You mean like those things in the ocean?

00:10:44.853 --> 00:10:49.149
My goodness, I've never
seen a jellyfish <i>ololl</i> before.

00:10:49.233 --> 00:10:50.442
I'll take one, please!

00:10:50.526 --> 00:10:53.654
--Hmm, I'll take that jellyfish there.
--What's this? It's adorable!

00:10:53.737 --> 00:10:54.738
It's a jellyfish doll.

00:10:54.822 --> 00:10:55.739
How much is it?

00:10:55.823 --> 00:10:56.448
Five hundred yen!

00:10:56.490 --> 00:10:58.116
How cute! What is it?

00:10:58.200 --> 00:11:00.035
That's a jellyfish doll!

00:11:00.118 --> 00:11:04.373
Somebody make a poster!
Otherwise nobody can tell they're jellyfish!

00:11:04.456 --> 00:11:05.707
A poster, you say?

00:11:05.791 --> 00:11:08.961
Something like, "Big seller! The only
handmade jellyfish doll in the world!

00:11:09.044 --> 00:11:12.840
Each one has a different face!"

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:14.675
"VVorld's Only Handmade Jellyfish Dolls" "Five Hundred
Yen Each" "To the restoration of the Han dynasty..."

00:11:14.675 --> 00:11:15.509
Don't draw stuff that makes no sense!

00:11:15.509 --> 00:11:16.927
"Jellyfish Dolls" "¥5oo"

00:11:16.927 --> 00:11:17.594
Trains aren't relevant!

00:11:17.594 --> 00:11:19.638
"I have a jellyfish doll, too."

00:11:19.638 --> 00:11:20.013
And neither is Takeo Chii!

00:11:20.097 --> 00:11:22.057
Forget it! Tsukimi--

00:11:31.066 --> 00:11:32.276
There!

00:11:32.359 --> 00:11:33.402
Flower hat jelly!

00:11:33.485 --> 00:11:34.361
Purple JQHY!

00:11:34.444 --> 00:11:35.612
Lion's mane jelly!

00:11:35.696 --> 00:11:37.072
Spotted jelly!

00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:39.867
There, done!

00:11:41.493 --> 00:11:44.204
Mayaya, move all that
Wedgewood stuff out of the way!

00:11:44.288 --> 00:11:45.664
We'll line 'em all up!

00:11:47.875 --> 00:11:48.667
"Stuffed Jellyfish Dolls" "¥500"

00:11:48.834 --> 00:11:49.918
"Stuffed Jellyfish Dolls" "¥500"

00:11:54.089 --> 00:11:57.676
Wait... all of them...?

00:11:57.759 --> 00:11:59.553
Sold out!

00:12:00.637 --> 00:12:01.680
It's commercial time!

00:12:01.763 --> 00:12:02.931
Clara!

00:12:04.057 --> 00:12:05.142
It's the second half!

00:12:05.225 --> 00:12:06.018
Tequila!

00:12:06.935 --> 00:12:10.314
Chieko, do you have a
piggy bank or something?

00:12:10.397 --> 00:12:12.190
Ah, yes...

00:12:13.317 --> 00:12:14.484
This will work.

00:12:14.568 --> 00:12:17.446
What's with this thing? It's just a carved bear.

00:12:17.529 --> 00:12:20.240
It looks like a woodcarving,
but it's actually ceramic.

00:12:20.324 --> 00:12:22.242
You put the money in here, see?

00:12:22.326 --> 00:12:26.038
No! Kumataro's been stabbed
in the back by a banknote!

00:12:26.121 --> 00:12:28.832
That curio perfectly symbolizes
the sacrifice of Earth's wildlife

00:12:28.916 --> 00:12:30.834
at the hands of the human ego.

00:12:30.918 --> 00:12:32.294
Listen up.

00:12:32.377 --> 00:12:36.173
We're going to save whatever we
can in here, and make it our war chest.

00:12:36.256 --> 00:12:37.424
War chest?

00:12:37.507 --> 00:12:38.717
Yep, our capital!

00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:42.429
To help us make a ton of jellyfish
dolls and sell them on the internet!

00:12:42.512 --> 00:12:46.141
You intend to draft us
into forced labor, don't you?!

00:12:46.224 --> 00:12:49.061
What's the big deal? None of
you are doing anything anyway.

00:12:49.144 --> 00:12:52.272
Do a little work for a change!

00:12:52.356 --> 00:12:54.107
The original Clara here!

00:12:54.191 --> 00:12:55.400
Coming in at #1 on this week's

00:12:55.484 --> 00:12:58.904
"Top Five Things You
Shouldn't Ask the Sisterhood":

00:12:58.904 --> 00:13:01.156
"Work!"

00:13:01.156 --> 00:13:01.406
"Work!"

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:04.076
Those who don't work don't eat, I say!

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:08.956
Hey, come to think of it, where's Tsukimi?

00:13:15.212 --> 00:13:16.380
Mom...

00:13:19.299 --> 00:13:25.138
Tsukimi, when you get married I'll
make you a dress just like this, okay?

00:13:25.222 --> 00:13:26.181
Mom...

00:13:26.264 --> 00:13:33.605
--A fluttery dress just like a princess's. --A girl
<i>like</i> me <i>will</i> never be able to get married, but...

00:13:33.689 --> 00:13:37.859
Or is it weird that jellyfish
remind me of princesses?

00:13:37.943 --> 00:13:39.945
<i>H'...</i>

00:13:40.028 --> 00:13:44.408
If, by some one-in-a-billion chance...

00:13:44.491 --> 00:13:45.701
Tsukimi!

00:13:45.784 --> 00:13:49.955
...I were to have a wedding day...

00:13:52.791 --> 00:13:55.919
<i>--..and if you were still alive...</i>

00:13:55.919 --> 00:13:58.296
<i>--I'm coming in!
--..and if you were still alive...</i>

00:14:00.465 --> 00:14:05.429
<i>I wonder what the wedding dress
you'd make me would look like?</i>

00:14:07.389 --> 00:14:08.557
Tsukimi?

00:14:11.893 --> 00:14:14.062
Are you suicidal?!

00:14:23.739 --> 00:14:27.117
What's with you?

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:31.997
Fine, I get it. <i>I'll</i> leave. <i>I'll</i> leave!

00:14:37.377 --> 00:14:42.340
M-My heart... No!

00:14:42.424 --> 00:14:45.343
<i>It's only because that idiot was
about to jump out the window.</i>

00:14:45.427 --> 00:14:48.013
<i>That's definitely why
my heart's pounding. Yeah.</i>

00:14:50.974 --> 00:14:52.267
Sheesh!

00:14:52.350 --> 00:14:54.895
Oh, that smells good! Black tea?

00:14:54.978 --> 00:14:56.772
No indeed! It is roasted tea!

00:14:56.855 --> 00:14:59.941
Oh, I see! I want some, too!

00:15:00.025 --> 00:15:01.193
Here you go.

00:15:01.276 --> 00:15:02.569
I sliced up some bean jelly, too.

00:15:02.652 --> 00:15:06.031
Thanks! Don't mind if I do!

00:15:28.178 --> 00:15:29.971
<i>It won't stop.</i>

00:15:30.055 --> 00:15:33.016
My heart won't stop pounding!

00:15:40.565 --> 00:15:42.150
Emergency!

00:15:42.234 --> 00:15:45.487
What happened?! Are you
choking on the bean jelly?!

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:47.531
Drink some tea!

00:15:49.908 --> 00:15:54.329
My chest... is clenching...

00:15:54.412 --> 00:15:57.374
This is a case for Vicks VapoRub!

00:15:57.457 --> 00:16:00.335
L-| don't think that's quite right...

00:16:00.418 --> 00:16:05.006
<i>Impossible... This is impossible.</i>

00:16:05.090 --> 00:16:08.552
<i>I've been</i> a <i>hit with the ladies since birth.</i>

00:16:08.635 --> 00:16:10.428
I... I, of all people...

00:16:14.015 --> 00:16:16.309
Fake boobs!

00:16:16.309 --> 00:16:17.727
"Fake Boobs"

00:16:20.147 --> 00:16:22.357
Tsukimi!

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:24.651
We've been tricked!

00:16:24.734 --> 00:16:25.569
Huh?

00:16:25.652 --> 00:16:29.114
Out of the goodness of our
hearts we brought the wretch Vicks,

00:16:29.197 --> 00:16:33.285
yet... yet... when we
yanked down that tube top...!

00:16:33.368 --> 00:16:37.622
She was wearing inserts!
She pretends to be stacked,

00:16:37.706 --> 00:16:41.501
but she's just a skinny, flat-chested
woman with too much makeup!

00:16:44.588 --> 00:16:46.631
I'm glad you came.

00:16:46.715 --> 00:16:49.467
I was worried you wouldn't.

00:16:49.551 --> 00:16:52.095
I'll leave as soon as our business is done.

00:16:52.179 --> 00:16:53.763
Oolong tea, please.

00:16:53.847 --> 00:16:55.974
--Right away, Sir.
--Dear me, you're not going to drink?

00:16:56.057 --> 00:16:57.267
No.

00:16:57.350 --> 00:17:02.022
Now, now. Coming to a bar and
saying you won't drink is just crass.

00:17:02.105 --> 00:17:04.482
Call me crass, then. I won't drink.

00:17:04.566 --> 00:17:07.068
Once you've said your piece, I'll go home.

00:17:07.152 --> 00:17:09.529
I don't have a "piece" to say.

00:17:12.157 --> 00:17:14.326
I just wanted to see you.

00:17:16.369 --> 00:17:19.915
If you won't have a drink...

00:17:19.998 --> 00:17:22.792
Perhaps I'll have you take me for a drive.

00:17:24.586 --> 00:17:31.051
"Koibuchi"

00:17:31.051 --> 00:17:31.927
What? I'm not bringing you home?

00:17:32.010 --> 00:17:33.470
Let's see...

00:17:34.596 --> 00:17:36.765
I guess I'll ask Sugi.

00:17:43.396 --> 00:17:47.359
That you, Sugi? Are you tailing Shu right now?

00:17:47.442 --> 00:17:51.071
He told me to bring the car
out to Roppongi for some reason,

00:17:51.154 --> 00:17:53.907
so I'm wondering if he's with that knockout...

00:17:53.990 --> 00:17:56.534
If he is, make sure you get the photos.

00:17:56.618 --> 00:17:59.996
Mr. Koibuchi won't stop
pestering me to find out about her.

00:18:10.340 --> 00:18:14.386
H-H-H-H-He saw me!

00:18:14.469 --> 00:18:18.974
I was seen by a member of
the last species I'd ever want to see me!

00:18:19.057 --> 00:18:21.685
He saw my ugly, undesirable self

00:18:21.768 --> 00:18:28.566
wrapped in tattered sheets and playing
like I was wearing a wedding dress!

00:18:37.617 --> 00:18:39.995
Ow...

00:18:40.078 --> 00:18:43.790
<i>Mom... What the heck is wrong with me?</i>

00:18:43.873 --> 00:18:48.670
<i>My heart speeding up until
I</i> can't <i>breathe--that's just pathetic!</i>

00:18:48.753 --> 00:18:51.548
<i>I wonder why Tsukimi
was dressed up like that...</i>

00:18:51.631 --> 00:18:56.344
<i>Wrapped up in white sheets,
with</i> an <i>old cloth on her head...</i>

00:18:56.428 --> 00:18:59.097
<i>Pretending to be a princess? At her age?</i>

00:18:59.180 --> 00:19:03.351
<i>Is she finally getting
interested in clothes, thanks to me?</i>

00:19:05.645 --> 00:19:07.230
In which case...

00:19:08.606 --> 00:19:13.111
You know what, Kuranosuke?
I have a big dream!

00:19:13.194 --> 00:19:17.282
I want to fill this closet with
gorgeous dresses from all over the world.

00:19:17.365 --> 00:19:19.951
That's my dream!

00:19:23.038 --> 00:19:28.835
<i>In which case, I wonder
what her face would look like</i>

00:19:28.918 --> 00:19:31.087
<i>if I showed her Mom's closet...</i>

00:19:41.181 --> 00:19:44.142
<i>Even if Mom were alive</i>

00:19:44.225 --> 00:19:51.232
<i>and she made me a dress of
snow-white lace like that jellyfish...</i>

00:19:51.316 --> 00:19:54.194
<i>To look good in it, I'd have to be pale-skinned,</i>

00:19:54.277 --> 00:19:59.449
<i>long-limbed, wide-eyed, long-lashed...</i>

00:20:04.871 --> 00:20:09.459
<i>So... like him, basically.</i>

00:20:17.842 --> 00:20:19.761
Hey! Don't run away!

00:20:19.844 --> 00:20:21.638
You dropped this!

00:20:23.181 --> 00:20:25.100
I don't want it! Throw it away!

00:20:25.183 --> 00:20:27.685
It's nothing to be so embarrassed about!

00:20:27.769 --> 00:20:31.064
Every girl plays "one-woman
fashion show" sometimes!

00:20:31.147 --> 00:20:33.400
I-I-I wasn't doing that!

00:20:33.483 --> 00:20:37.779
I just remembered something
my mom said, so I was testing it out!

00:20:37.862 --> 00:20:38.822
Your mom?

00:20:38.905 --> 00:20:43.701
Mom told me she would
make me a dress like a jellyfish!

00:20:45.745 --> 00:20:52.127
So making jellyfish dolls this
afternoon, I remembered that!

00:20:52.210 --> 00:20:53.002
Tsukimi...

00:20:53.086 --> 00:20:55.630
P-Please don't tell the others!

00:20:55.713 --> 00:20:57.215
Tsukimi!

00:20:57.298 --> 00:20:58.883
Let's make one!

00:20:59.926 --> 00:21:02.095
Let's make a jellyfish dress!

00:21:03.555 --> 00:21:06.641
We'll make jellyfish dresses,
sell them, rake in the dough...

00:21:06.724 --> 00:21:10.270
...get famous... become billionaires...

00:21:10.353 --> 00:21:13.648
Um, what are you talking about?

00:21:13.731 --> 00:21:17.318
...and then use the money to buy this place!

00:21:21.239 --> 00:21:30.248
<i>Hontou ni kizuite hoshii n da,
anata ga utsukushii tte koto wo</i>

00:21:30.331 --> 00:21:34.669
Ima made naze kizukanai no sa

00:21:34.752 --> 00:21:39.174
<i>Kokoro nakushita mitai da yo</i>

00:21:39.257 --> 00:21:48.349
<i>Sugu ni sugu ni kizuite hoshii, wakatte hoshii yo</i>

00:21:48.433 --> 00:22:02.822
<i>Sugu ni kimi ni kizuite hoshii,
kimi no kirei ni kizuite hoshii yo</i>

00:22:04.199 --> 00:22:08.661
Anata <i>ga</i> totemo kirei dakara

00:22:08.745 --> 00:22:12.749
Anata ni sore wo tsutaetai no sa

00:22:12.832 --> 00:22:22.425
<i>ltsumademo, itsumademo kimi utsukushisa wo</i>

00:22:22.509 --> 00:22:30.850
Anata <i>ga</i> jibun no utsukushisa ni
kizuitara boku <i>wa</i> shiawase nan da

00:22:30.934 --> 00:22:35.647
<i>Boku wa kimi wo omotteru yo</i>

00:22:35.730 --> 00:22:44.989
<i>Kimi no kirei ni kizuite okure</i>
